<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!-- ====================================================================
       THE ORBITAL GATE

       Uses USH_Glitterheart - Ushanka's own item, not a duplicate. It is
       already uncraftable, already tradeability Sellable (you can sell one,
       you cannot buy one), and already stackLimit 3.

       Ushanka gates BUILDING on hearts (three glitterpanels and the targeter,
       1 each) but leaves RESEARCH free behind craftable benches. These defs
       add the research half, so the tree cannot be climbed from the ground.

       SCOPE: 10 of 18 projects. Core materials and production only. The other
       8 - telepad, teeth, overclock, skin, and the four skilltrainer lines -
       are deliberately left free. They are conveniences, not the point.

       COSTS, per the agreed shape:
         3 hearts  USH_GlittertechFabrication  - the fabricator, gates all
                                                 downstream production. The
                                                 single most expensive unlock.
         2 hearts  the seven production/deep projects
         1 heart   the two entry-tier projects

       Total demand: 3 + 14 + 2 = 19 hearts for the whole gated tree, plus
       roughly 4-6 for Ushanka's own building costs. Call it ~25.
       ==================================================================== -->

  <!-- ===================== 3 hearts: the keystone ===================== -->

  <ResearchMakesSense.ManualAnalysisDef>
    <defName>Archinity_GT_Fabrication</defName>
    <researchProject>USH_GlittertechFabrication</researchProject>
    <reverseEngineeringMaterials>
      <li>USH_Glitterheart</li>
    </reverseEngineeringMaterials>
    <reverseEngineeringPointsRequired>3</reverseEngineeringPointsRequired>
    <theoreticalMaterials>
      <li>ComponentSpacer</li>
    </theoreticalMaterials>
    <theoreticalPointsRequired>8</theoreticalPointsRequired>
  </ResearchMakesSense.ManualAnalysisDef>

